{"chars": "And for one magical moment, summer disappeared. The air turned icy. Deep, soft snow lay all around them, glowing blue in the dim winter light, and the forest was silent. There was no flower spike, no bumblebee, no huckleberries. But under the snow, where the Elder had brushed a little window clear, the dark green leaves were still there, alive and green, their silver veins shining, quietly waiting. Beside them stood one tall, dry, old flower stalk, straight up out of the snow.", "start": [0.25, 0.25, 0.25, 0.375, 0.375, 0.375, 0.375, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.5, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 0.725, 1.15, 1.15, 1.15, 1.15, 1.15, 1.15, 1.15, 1.55, 1.637, 1.637, 1.637, 1.637, 1.637, 1.637, 1.637, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 1.925, 2.975, 3.075, 3.075, 3.075, 3.075, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.225, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.45, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 3.812, 4.5, 4.638, 4.638, 4.638, 4.638, 4.638, 4.9, 4.963, 4.963, 4.963, 4.963, 4.963, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.25, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.525, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.725, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 5.925, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.237, 6.425, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.5, 6.9, 6.9, 6.9, 6.9, 6.9, 7.162, 7.162, 7.162, 7.237, 7.237, 7.237, 7.237, 7.325, 7.325, 7.325, 7.325, 7.55, 7.55, 7.55, 7.55, 7.55, 7.55, 7.55, 7.85, 7.85, 7.85, 7.85, 7.85, 7.85, 8.1, 8.137, 8.137, 8.137, 8.137, 8.238, 8.238, 8.238, 8.238, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.338, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.738, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 8.863, 9.675, 9.775, 9.775, 9.775, 9.775, 9.775, 9.775, 9.912, 9.912, 9.912, 9.912, 10.025, 10.025, 10.025, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.238, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.6, 10.95, 11.0, 11.0, 11.0, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.175, 11.6, 11.637, 11.637, 11.637, 11.825, 11.825, 11.825, 11.825, 11.825, 11.825, 11.825, 11.825, 11.